VDU Get Pod Info
    [Documentation]  This keyword is used to get vdu pod information
    ...  It supports multi gnbs in one testline.
    ...  Connect to vdu cluster via tenant user
    ...
    ...    |    Input Parameters     | Man. | Description |
    ...    |   vdu_index             | No  | vdu index in testline configuration file. Default is 0. |
    ...    |   gnb_index             | No |  gnb index in testline configurtion file. Default is 0. |
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...   vdu_pod_info， including age, ip, name, node, nominated_node, readiness_gates, ready, restarts, status
    ...
    [Arguments]  ${conn_prompt}=${EMPTY}  ${vdu_index}=0    ${gnb_index}=0
    ${alias}    generic_utils.get_unique_id_string
    ${namespace}   tl_config.get_vdu_namespace    vdu_index=${vdu_index}    gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    ssh_conn.connect_to_vdu_cloud_hosting
    ...  using_tenant=${True}
    ...  prompt=${conn_prompt}
    ...  vdu_index=${vdu_index}
    ...  gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    ...  alias=${alias}
    ${vdu_pod_info}    vdu_cli_base.get_vdu_pod_info   namespace=${namespace}   alias=${alias}
    [return]    ${vdu_pod_info}
    [Teardown]    ssh_conn.disconnect_vdu_cloud_hosting  alias=${alias}


